\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Remark}
\title{Reward-model validation depends on its population}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{reward-model}

\p{Ouyang et al. hold out comparison data and report reward-model validation
accuracy and loss in \citet{Section 3.5 and Appendix C.2}{ouyang2022training}.
Representing the validation population by a probability law makes the
estimand depend explicitly on the judge population and acquisition procedure.}

\p{This law belongs to reward-model validation. It is not the independent task
evaluation used later to compare post-training protocols.}
